  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Health Programme Coordinator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tonga Health Programme Coordinator will coordinate all of MFAT&apos;s health investments in Tonga (bilateral and multi-country) to ensure: complementarity across activities, effective implementation, strong local ownership and coordination with development partners.&#xa0;The Tonga Health Programme Coordinator is a 12 month pilot project which will be reviewed at&#xa0;9 months to determine ongoing need and focus of the role.</narrative>
  </description>
